From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: perlytiara <12584332+perlytiara@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 20:47:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] Vault fork: icon, logos and colour come from the Taviri
 brand kit

The brand kit shared with the web vault (brandKit in vault/brand.properties,
brand/ in the Taviri repository) is copied into vault/brand/kit on every build and
converted: glyph.svg becomes the launcher icon layers, the start-up logo and
the status bar icon; mark.svg + glyph.svg the autofill pop-up logo; logo.svg
the login-screen logo; brand.json's colour the icon background and, with an
empty `hue`, the palette hue. Without a kit the built-in placeholder mark and
an Inter wordmark are drawn as before.

README: the kit, and the planned server address (Tailscale name,
home-network fallback with its own CA).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
